  "title": "tap-expert: encapsulate a bit more state",
  "description": "Move `lowest_report_level` out of a global variable and into the\n`expert_tapdata_t` for the tap state. Improves encapsulation in the\n(admittedly unlikely) event that more than one expert tap is registered\nat a time.\n\nAlso replace `0` with `TL_REQUIRES_NOTHING` to improve code\nself-documentation.\n\nI'm looking at CLI taps for #20432. This tap already has reset and free callbacks defined, so no major changes are needed. Feel free to close if this is too bikesheddy.",
