        {
          "id": 2452501934,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "For this specific tap, the following command seems valid and produces somewhat-usable results (with or, surprisingly, without this patch):\n\n    tshark -q -z expert,error,dhcp -z expert,warning,tcp -r some_file.pcapng\n\nI say \"somewhat\" usable because, while it generates a separate output for each tap, it doesn't distinguish which output is for which filter. More work could be done to improve this.\n\nIn the general case I agree with what you're saying. This won't fix all the singletons, and the others also need fixed at some point.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6020526,
            "username": "boolean263",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "David Perry",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6020526/avatar.png?v=1788830706",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/boolean263"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-04-15T15:09:17.216Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-04-16T09:44:51.684Z",
